  "screen.thaumiclegacy.journal.alchemy.unlocked.body": "Set the crucible over a heat source and fill it with water. Once ready, dissolve ingredients to collect aspects. Add a recipe catalyst when its required aspects are present.",
  "screen.thaumiclegacy.journal.node_basics.locked.title": "Aura Nodes",
  "screen.thaumiclegacy.journal.node_basics.locked.body": "Complete Comparing Specimens or find and scan an aura node.",
  "screen.thaumiclegacy.journal.node_basics.unlocked.title": "Aura Nodes",
  "screen.thaumiclegacy.journal.node_basics.unlocked.body": "Nodes hold six separate primal Vis reserves. Equip the Goggles of Revealing to locate nearby nodes.",
  "screen.thaumiclegacy.journal.node_study.locked.title": "Node Study",
  "screen.thaumiclegacy.journal.node_study.locked.body": "Aim the Thaumometer at an aura node and use it to record your first study.",
  "screen.thaumiclegacy.journal.node_study.unlocked.title": "Node Study",
  "screen.thaumiclegacy.journal.node_study.unlocked.body": "Distinct nodes studied: %s.",
  "screen.thaumiclegacy.journal.wand_charging.locked.title": "Wand Charging",
  "screen.thaumiclegacy.journal.wand_charging.locked.body": "After recording a node, use your wand on a node with Vis to complete this entry.",
  "screen.thaumiclegacy.journal.wand_charging.unlocked.title": "Wand Charging",
  "screen.thaumiclegacy.journal.wand_charging.unlocked.body": "You have drawn Vis from a node. Inspect the wand to see its current primal charges.",
  "block.thaumiclegacy.infernal_furnace": "Infernal Furnace",
  "screen.thaumiclegacy.journal.infernal_furnace.locked.title": "Infernal Furnace",
  "screen.thaumiclegacy.journal.infernal_furnace.locked.body": "Complete Arcane Foundations and Wand Charging to unlock this entry.",
  "screen.thaumiclegacy.journal.infernal_furnace.unlocked.title": "Infernal Furnace",
  "screen.thaumiclegacy.journal.infernal_furnace.unlocked.body": "Build three 3×3 layers. Base: nine Nether Bricks. Middle: seven Obsidian, a lava source at the center, and Iron Bars in the center of the front side. Top: eight Nether Bricks around an air opening. Use a wand charged with 12 Ignis and 12 Terra on the outer face of the bars. Use smeltable items on the grate to load them, an empty hand to collect the results, and sneak with empty hands to recover queued input. The shell transforms when activated. Breaking any part extinguishes the furnace, returns the surviving shell to its original blocks and drops stored items. Attach up to four bellows at the left, right, rear and underside of the central cell. The Ignis inlet faces out from the block directly above the grate.",
  "block.thaumiclegacy.arcane_bellows": "Arcane Bellows",
  "block.thaumiclegacy.infernal_furnace_part": "Infernal Furnace Shell",
  "message.thaumiclegacy.infernal_furnace.status": "%1$s Bellows: %2$s/4 · Ignis reserve: %3$s · Boost ticks: %4$s",
  "message.thaumiclegacy.infernal_furnace.working": "The furnace is smelting.",
  "message.thaumiclegacy.infernal_furnace.paused": "Smelting paused. Check the recipe and clear the output buffers.",
  "screen.thaumiclegacy.journal.arcane_bellows.locked.title": "Arcane Bellows",
  "screen.thaumiclegacy.journal.arcane_bellows.locked.body": "Discover the Infernal Furnace first.",
  "screen.thaumiclegacy.journal.arcane_bellows.unlocked.title": "Arcane Bellows",
  "screen.thaumiclegacy.journal.arcane_bellows.unlocked.body": "Mount bellows against the exterior of the central lava layer on the left, right and rear, and under the base center. Each additional bellows accelerates smelting with diminishing gains. Connect an Ignis tube to the outward face of the block directly above the front grate.",
  "message.thaumiclegacy.infernal_furnace.invalid": "The furnace does not match the pattern. Use the outer face of the iron bars.",
  "message.thaumiclegacy.infernal_furnace.unloaded": "Part of the furnace is in an unloaded chunk.",
  "message.thaumiclegacy.infernal_furnace.research": "Discover the Infernal Furnace in the Thaumonomicon first.",
